echKo":"동사","definitionKo":"식혀서 차게 하다.","englishExpression":"cool; freeze","englishDescription":"To cool and then freeze something.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=41174&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:66008:1","headword":"시원스럽다","partOfSpeech":"adjective","partOfSpeechKo":"형용사","definitionKo":"덥지도 춥지도 않고 적당하게 서늘한 듯하다.","englishExpression":"cool","englishDescription":"Feeling moderately cool, neither hot nor cold.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66008&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:66091:1","headword":"싸늘하다","partOfSpeech":"adjective","partOfSpeechKo":"형용사","definitionKo":"물체의 온도나 기온이 약간 차다.","englishExpression":"cool; chilly","englishDescription":"Something being a little cold, or the temperature being low.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66091&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:66092:1","headword":"싸느랗다","partOfSpeech":"adjective","partOfSpeechKo":"형용사","definitionKo":"물체의 온도나 기온이 약간 차다.","englishExpression":"cool; chilly","englishDescription":"Something being a little cold, or the temperature being low.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66092&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:71281:1","headword":"시원하다","partOfSpeech":"adjective","partOfSpeechKo":"형용사","definitionKo":"덥지도 춥지도 않고 적당하게 서늘하다.","englishExpression":"cool","englishDescription":"Moderately cool, neither hot nor cold.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71281&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:71281:2","headword":"시원하다","partOfSpeech":"adjective","partOfSpeechKo":"형용사","definitionKo":"음식이 먹기 좋을 정도로 차고 산뜻하거나, 속이 후련할 정도로 뜨겁다.","englishExpression":"cool; hot","englishDescription":"Food being cold and refreshing and thus it is good to eat, or being hot enough to make one feel refreshed.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?Para