 나타내는 말.","englishExpression":"gyeom","englishDescription":"A bound noun used to indicate that someone is doing one thing while doing another.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=30408&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"hay":[{"id":"krdict:25263:1","headword":"건초","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"주로 짐승의 먹이나 거름으로 쓰는, 베어서 말린 풀.","englishExpression":"hay; dry grass","englishDescription":"Cut, dried grass generally used to feed livestock or as manure.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25263&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:77813:1","headword":"지푸라기","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"하나하나의 짚. 또는 짚의 부스러기.","englishExpression":"straw; hay","englishDescription":"Each and every single straw; or shreds of straw.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=77813&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"kkotsang-yeo":[{"id":"krdict:17526:1","headword":"꽃상여","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"꽃으로 장식된, 사람의 시체를 묘지까지 나르는 도구.","englishExpression":"kkotsang-yeo; colorfully decorated bier","englishDescription":"A carrier decorated with flowers, used to carry a human corpse to a grave.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=17526&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"magnificently":[{"id":"krdict:87891:1","headword":"황홀히","partOfSpeech":"adverb","partOfSpeechKo":"부사","definitionKo":"눈이 부셔 흐릿하게 보일 정도로 아름답고 화려하게.","englishExpression":"magnificently; splendidly; brilliantly","englishDescription":"In a state of looking dazzlingly beautiful and splendid.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87891&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:89308:1","headword":"훌륭히","partOfSpeech":"adverb","partOfSpeechKo":"부사","definitionKo":"칭찬할 만큼 매우 좋고 뛰어나게.","englishExpression":"well; remarkably; nicely; magnificently","englishDescription":"In the manner of